<title>ISRAEL: Israel Corp Q3 loss 8.8 million shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel Corp Q3 loss 8.8 million shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Israel Corp</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			     Q3 96    Q3 95   9-MTH 96   9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		 765,926 1,017,390  2,485,192  2,757,673</p>
<p>Pre-tax Profit	 Loss68    98,856     72,407    141,156</p>
<p>Net Profit	  Loss8,751    59,521     40,966     59,898</p>
<p>Earnings per Share Loss1.57     12.61	 7.34	12.69</p>
<p>($1 = 3.24 shekels)</p>
</text>
